# Task Scheduler with Activity Selection

This project implements a Task Scheduler system using:

- Greedy Activity Selection Algorithm
- Brute Force Algorithm

The system selects the maximum number of non-overlapping tasks from a given list of tasks.

---

## Features

- Task scheduling using Greedy Algorithm
- Brute Force comparison
- Maximum non-overlapping task selection
- Time complexity comparison
- Optimality verification

---

## Programming Language

C Programming Language

---

## Input

The user provides:

- Start time
- End time

for multiple tasks.

---

## Algorithms Used

### Greedy Algorithm
- Sorts tasks by finishing time
- Selects tasks efficiently
- Produces optimal result

### Brute Force Algorithm
- Checks all possible combinations
- Finds the best valid schedule
- Slower for large input sizes

---

## Time Complexity

| Algorithm | Complexity |
|---|---|
| Greedy Algorithm | O(n²) |
| Brute Force | O(n × 2ⁿ) |

